{
  "name": "Mascot welcomes new batch of residents to EA campuses",
  "parent_id": 203314091625658,
  "group_id": "e9fb1645-2848-4758-a309-ac135fca0f71",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:21:21.385Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:13:41.745Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:13:41.731Z",
  "id": 203981133397162,
  "uuid": "fad72d8c-4b0d-452c-8d77-3d4ed98e37e5",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "8c2b21e4-7c3c-557d-1af9-61933c4a8a25",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "a463ff6c-af6c-fb7d-431a-d1ebaae2bb26",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "First things first, word is that you are good in shooting hoops.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes, I played basketball at a semi-professional level for a local club while in high school and represented Tanzania at the Federation of East Africa Secondary Schools Sports Associations games in 2011. When my schedule allows I get on the court. I've heard about the ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "AKU Sports Olympiad",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/events/sports-olympiad/Pages/home.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_self",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ", which has a basketball category. That's impressive and I hope to participate in the games! ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Why did you pick medicine as a career? ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "I wanted something that is always changing, keeps me curious and on my toes. I chose ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Obstetrics and Gynaecology",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/mcea/obs-gyn/Pages/home.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_self",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " as a specialty as I have always been impressed with how the human body works to keep you alive and well. There is a need for more specialists in Tanzania and I look forward to being part of the wider ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "AKU alumni ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/alumni/Pages/home.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_self",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "community made up of leaders on the nursing and midwifery, medicine, education and media fronts. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In addition, we are the ones that help to bring new life into the world, what's not to love? ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "You are starting a new journey amidst a pandemic, what does this mean to you?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "With Corona set to be around for a while and the whole world trying to figure its way around the pandemic, I look forward to rising above the unprecedented challenges. It remains a bit scary as no one knows what to anticipate; we have a new strain of the virus and there are mixed results from the developed vaccines. As a frontliner, I have to remain true to my calling to help alleviate human suffering and learn something new from my residency years at AKU, especially from my peers in the Kenya and Tanzania campuses. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "This residency also means a lot to me since my late father encouraged me to give it a go. So I feel like I am honouring his wishes.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Recommend a medical movie or TV show that I can binge on this weekend.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Try Grey's Anatomy! I love the series as it showcases the human side of medicine that never gets to be seen, or we tend to forget about. Most of the time we tend to forget that doctors are humans. Binge on it, you will thank me later!",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Thank you Dr Vicky, and Karibu* AKU.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Asante**, I hope to stumble on your paws along the corridors. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "* Karibu means welcome in Swahili.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "**Asante means thank you in Swahili",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
