    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Our AKU family continues to grow with 37 residents joining us in nine areas of clinical specialisation at the Medical College, East Africa. With a cohort that has many talents outside the classroom, our roaming mascot spotted Dr Vicky Kapesi, who aside from practicing medicine, loves to get on the basketball court and has previously represented Tanzania on the regional stage. Here is how their first meeting went:",
